1
00:00:00,584 --> 00:00:03,044
(Penny:)Sheldon, honey, I've told you,
it's a small apartment.

2
00:00:03,211 --> 00:00:05,881
(Penny:)- You only have to knock one...
- I don't have a lot of time.

3
00:00:06,047 --> 00:00:10,677
(Sheldon:)Look, Ramona finally dozed off,
and I need you to help me get rid of her.

4
00:00:12,637 --> 00:00:14,767
(Penny:)Get rid of her how?

5
00:00:14,931 --> 00:00:18,601
(Sheldon:)I don't know, but, apparently,
I'm in some kind of relationship...

6
00:00:18,768 --> 00:00:22,018
...and, well, you seem to be an expert
at ending them.

7
00:00:25,984 --> 00:00:27,114
(Ramona:)Excuse me?

8
00:00:27,277 --> 00:00:30,697
(Sheldon:)I see man after man
leaving this apartment never to return.

9
00:00:31,781 --> 00:00:34,451
(Penny:)Okay, first of all, it is not man after man.

10
00:00:34,618 --> 00:00:36,998
RAMONA: Dr. Cooper?
- Hide me.

11
00:00:38,371 --> 00:00:41,121
- Hide you?
- I formally request sanctuary.

12
00:00:42,792 --> 00:00:44,002
(Ramona:)Why aren't you working?

13
00:00:44,336 --> 00:00:45,666
(Leonard:)Um...

14
00:00:46,338 --> 00:00:48,508
(Sheldon:)She distracted me.

15
00:00:49,299 --> 00:00:51,509
(Sheldon:)I told you,
I don't have time for your nonsense.

16
00:00:51,676 --> 00:00:54,346
(Sheldon:)I have important things to do.

17
00:00:56,514 --> 00:00:59,224
- Oh, man.
- I know what's going on here.

